            "answer": "<h4>SAFETY</h4><p>Security is a top priority for our services, as everyone needs protection before they can connect.Please see details of our technical tests, certifications and compliance with the corresponding directives.</p><h4>WARRANTY</h4><p>We promise all direct purchasers of our devices to be free from hardware quality and software system defects for one year from the date of purchase.If your device is under warranty, please contact the source of your purchase. If your device is out of warranty, or if you need further assistance, please send your order number to<a href=\"mailto:support@glocalme.com\">support@glocalme.com</a></p>",
