            "answer": "<p>Our return policy is simple, you can return the device(s) you bought within 30 days of product dispatch following the below guidelines.Before returning device, please note the following problems can be solved by a simple restart.</p><ul><li>Data failed to synchronize with APP</li><li>Fail to response to actions</li><li>Charged device cannot be switched on</li><li>Fail to connect</li></ul>",
